            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to your fury level. You can spend 1 rage dice. If you do:
• Add 1 to each roll.
• If your opponent&apos;s fury level is lower than yours, they must increase their fury level by 1, to a maximum of 7.
Then, for each 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
