                      <description>Your hero&apos;s **Choppa** or **Hacka** has **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is 1 of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**.</description>
