            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. This unit can move a distance in inches up to the value of the roll. Then, if possible, your opponent must remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again within 1&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
