            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within 6&quot; of the battlefield edge, remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 6&quot; of the battlefield edge and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
